ounty hunter races off to slay goblins, Alita is captured by Dr. Akamashi. Falis returns for a daring rescue, but she'll need help to even the odds.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-05-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8qocn9VOvm4UU01ioLvUVQkcr0P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8qocn9VOvm4UU01ioLvUVQkcr0P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/95039/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1971733","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Prince Kaito's return has Falis and her crew planning their departure. Although crushed, Alita reluctantly accepts her friend's desire for adventure. But before they part ways, a mysterious woman uses her powers to cast the heroes as outlaws.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-06-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xS02T0BoYLUqOp3XFmoh8umlNCc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xS02T0BoYLUqOp3XFmoh8umlNCc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/95039/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1971734","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Falis is badly wounded during a daring escape. With Kaito and the royal army in hot pursuit, the unlikely band of allies strikes out for the border - until Dominikov's fireside revelations reveal the powerful force drawing evil to Forland.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2007-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":30,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z55I6pZ5IdwFoleODecQRRI58wT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z55I6pZ5IdwFoleODecQRRI58wT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/95039/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1971735","seasonNumber